meta {
  name: Resolve skill
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

get {
  url: {{backend_url}}/model-hub/skills/resolve/?name={{skill_name}}&label=production&include_content=false
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  X-Api-Key: {{api_key}}
  X-Secret-Key: {{secret_key}}
  X-Workspace-Id: {{workspace_id}}
}

docs {
  REST returns all file metadata and frontmatter by default. Add file_limit (1–25)
  and file_offset (starting at 0) to page the inventory. Each response includes
  file_count, file_offset and next_file_offset. Until next_file_offset is null,
  request the next page with that offset and pin version to the returned immutable
  version number instead of sending label. Do not send If-None-Match when fetching
  a new page; the ETag identifies the immutable version, not the page.

  MCP get_skill always pages (default 25) and omits file contents and frontmatter
  to preserve its 64 KiB response limit even for 200 maximum-length paths or
  expanded YAML metadata. Read SKILL.md with read_skill_file, following next_offset
  until eof, for the original frontmatter and instructions. No file metadata is
  truncated; discover every file by following next_file_offset.
}
